  "book.universe.probe_log.page.1": "UNV-7 SURVEY PROBE LOG\n\nMain engine failure. Forced landing on this planet. Hull breached, primary systems offline.\n\nTo whoever finds this: the gear aboard can still be repaired.",
  "book.universe.probe_log.page.2": "[MULTITOOL]\nDamaged in the impact. Two copper ingots, two redstone and an iron ingot will fix it.\n\nHold USE: mining laser. It overheats if fired too long.\nSneak + USE: scan for nearby ore veins.",
  "book.universe.probe_log.page.3": "[EXOSUIT]\nHelmet and chestplate seal in your oxygen; the full set holds off cold, heat, toxins and radiation.\n\nOxygen capsules: bottled leaves.\nHazard cells: copper, redstone, coal.\n\nJetpack: jump again in mid-air.",
  "book.universe.probe_log.page.4": "[SHIPS]\nBuild one from blocks: a helm, thrusters, fuel tanks; dress the hull as you like. Use the helm to assemble.\n\nFill the tanks with launch fuel (coal, gunpowder, a glass bottle).\nClimb past the sky to reach space.",
  "book.universe.probe_log.page.5": "[COURSE]\nThis planet has a moon: airless and cold, but rich in titanium.\n\nIn space the impulse engine gets you there fast. Fly into a body's atmosphere to land.\n\nBetter equipment needs titanium.",
  "book.universe.probe_log.page.6": "[MISSION]\nThis probe belongs to the Universe Survey Programme.\nAll other probes have gone silent.\n\nMore worlds in this system await mapping.\n\n— END OF LOG —",
  "book.universe.probe_log.title": "Probe Log",
